## Command

```shell
biome completion --write zsh
```

## `<HOME_DIR>/.zfunc/_biome`

```zfunc/_biome
#compdef biome
local line
line="${words[1]} --bpaf-complete-rev=7 ${words[@]:1}"
if [[ ${words[-1]} == "" ]]; then
    line="${line} \"\""
fi
source <(eval ${line})


```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Wrote zsh completions to <HOME_DIR>/.zfunc/_biome.
To enable them, add this line to your .zshrc before compinit runs, then restart the shell:
  fpath+=(~/.zfunc)
```
